    {
      "image": "videos/09-chess-master-memory/3.jpg",
      "seconds": 18.31,
      "text": "Expertise is compression. The novice reads letters. The reader sees words. Same ink, a fraction of the load. Which means the expert is not running a bigger engine. They are carrying a smaller file. And it also means the advantage is specific. Take the pattern away, and the master is back on the same footing as everyone else.",
